    <item>
      <title>Ahmad Faraz on Separation</title>
      <link>http://192.168.0.109:1313/shayari/2026-02-08-tum-ho-to-main-nahi-hun-main/</link>
      <pubDate>Sun, 08 Feb 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://192.168.0.109:1313/shayari/2026-02-08-tum-ho-to-main-nahi-hun-main/</guid>
      <description>&lt;div class=&#34;shayari-original&#34;&gt;
تم ہو تو میں نہیں ہوں، میں ہوں تو تم نہیں ہوتے
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Tum ho to main nahi hun, main hun to tum nahi hotay&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;translation&#34;&gt;Translation&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are, I am not; if I am, you are not&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Faiz Ahmed Faiz on Dil ne lo chihrayaa, dukh to ban gaye</title>
      <link>http://192.168.0.109:1313/shayari/2026-02-08-/</link>
      <pubDate>Sun, 08 Feb 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://192.168.0.109:1313/shayari/2026-02-08-/</guid>
      <description>&lt;div class=&#34;shayari-original&#34;&gt;
دل نے لو چھیڑاہ، دکھ تو بن گئے
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;میرے لیے شبِ انتظار، تم ہو جدا&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;translation&#34;&gt;Translation&lt;/h3&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Gulzar on Separation</title>
      <link>http://192.168.0.109:1313/shayari/2026-02-08-beeta-nahin-magar-yun-lagta-ha/</link>
      <pubDate>Sun, 08 Feb 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://192.168.0.109:1313/shayari/2026-02-08-beeta-nahin-magar-yun-lagta-ha/</guid>
      <description>&lt;div class=&#34;shayari-original&#34;&gt;
بیتا نہیں مگر یوں لگتا ہے کہ کہیں کھو گیا ہوں
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Beeta nahin magar yun lagta hai ke kahin kho gaya hoon&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;translation&#34;&gt;Translation&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I haven&amp;rsquo;t died, yet it feels like I am lost.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>The Art of Leaving</title>
      <link>http://192.168.0.109:1313/shayari/first_grief/</link>
      <pubDate>Sun, 08 Feb 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://192.168.0.109:1313/shayari/first_grief/</guid>
      <description>&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Kaun is ghar ki dekh-bhaal kare&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Roz ek cheez toot jaati hai.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;translation&#34;&gt;Translation&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Who is there to look after this house?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Every day, something breaks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The emptiness of a house without you is not silence.
It is a noise that only I can hear.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
